{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"samSelectDetailRegion","symbolKind":"func","externalID":"c:@F@samSelectDetailRegion","modules":[{"name":"DotFaceCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Function","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/samSelectDetailRegion","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"int","preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/sam_color_image","text":"SamColorImage","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@sam_color_image","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"image","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"int","preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"detectedObjectBoundingBox","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"int","preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"selectedBoundingBox","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":");","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0 on success, or a non-zero error code on failure."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analyzes the input image and identifies the most suitable 200x200 pixel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"region (bounding box) with high level of details that intersects a given bounding box."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is empty (width or height is 0), any region can be selected. Otherwise,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the selected region should have non-empty intersection with this bounding box. The selected region"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should lie fully inside the input image."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is no region satisfying these conditions - if image width or height is smaller than 200"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"type":"text","text":" lies outside the image, the selected bounding box will be (0, 0, 200, 200)."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["                                  a bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height)."],"syntax":null},{"type":"codeListing","code":["                                  return, contains the bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height),","                                  where width and height are always set to 200."],"syntax":null}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/samselectdetailregion"]}],"references":{"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore/samSelectDetailRegion":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/samselectdetailregion","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"}],"type":"topic","title":"samSelectDetailRegion","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/samSelectDetailRegion"},"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore/